{"title":"Career Roadmap · Accessory Designer","role":"Accessory Designer","summary":"An Accessory Designer develops functional and aesthetic fashion/lifestyle accessories such as bags, wallets, belts, jewellery, footwear accessories, eyewear, travel accessories, small leather goods and lifestyle products. The role combines trend research, material knowledge, sketching, 3D development, craftsmanship, ergonomics, manufacturing and commercial understanding.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Lifestyle / Accessory / Footwear / Leather Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Accessory Designer develops functional and aesthetic fashion/lifestyle accessories such as bags, wallets, belts, jewellery, footwear accessories, eyewear, travel accessories, small leather goods and lifestyle products. The role combines trend research, material knowledge, sketching, 3D development, craftsmanship, ergonomics, manufacturing and commercial understanding."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Lifestyle/Accessory/Footwear/Leather Design","Design Internship","Assistant Accessory Designer","Accessory Designer","Senior Designer","Design Lead","Design Manager / Creative Director"],"label":"Typical route"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Years","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Design, materials, sketching and craft"}],[{"text":"Exploration"},{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Accessory categories and construction"}],[{"text":"Product Development"},{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"CAD, prototyping and manufacturing"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"Design Intern / Assistant Designer"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Commercial accessory collections"}],[{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Independent product/collection ow